sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Listener as Praxis Listener<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Pipeline as Filter Pipeline
    participant Router as Router Filter
    participant Upstream as Upstream Cluster<br/>Configurable
    participant Monitor as Monitoring System
    participant Health as Health/Metrics<br/>9902/TCP HTTP
    participant HealthRunner as Health Check Runner

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: HTTP Proxy Request
        Client->>Listener: HTTP/HTTPS Request<br/>Optional TLS (rustls+OpenSSL)<br/>Optional mTLS
        Note over Listener: Reserved header check<br/>Reject x-praxis-*, x-ext-protocol-*,<br/>x-ext-agent-* with 400
        Listener->>Pipeline: Forward to filter chain<br/>In-process
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: Execute filters:<br/>security → traffic → transform → observability
        Pipeline->>Router: Route decision<br/>path, host, headers
        Router->>Upstream: Forward request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS<br/>TLS verification on by default
        Upstream-->>Router: Response
        Router-->>Pipeline: Response filters<br/>In-process
        Note over Pipeline: Strip reserved headers<br/>from backend response
        Pipeline-->>Listener: Filtered response
        Listener-->>Client: HTTP/HTTPS Response
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Monitor,Health: Flow 2: Health/Metrics Probing
        Monitor->>Health: GET /healthy<br/>HTTP 9902/TCP
        Health-->>Monitor: {"status":"ok"}
        Monitor->>Health: GET /ready<br/>HTTP 9902/TCP
        Health-->>Monitor: Upstream health status
        Monitor->>Health: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 9902/TCP
        Health-->>Monitor: Prometheus metrics
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over HealthRunner,Upstream: Flow 3: Active Health Checking
        loop Periodic health checks
            HealthRunner->>Upstream: HTTP/TCP/gRPC probe<br/>Depends on cluster TLS config
            Upstream-->>HealthRunner: Health response
            HealthRunner->>HealthRunner: Update health registry
        end
    end
